WEBVTT

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:41.490
"Indeed, I am resentful."

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.750
Demon Pond

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.810
Shirayuki...

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:06.230
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:15.100
The cutlet at Rengatei was so good.

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.780
Ougai-san...

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.910
Then stay. Stay as long as you like.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:27.070
I want to.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.530
I want to stay here forever.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:37.390
I can send you back on the next full moon.

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:47.170
It's really coming down.

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:51.410
With the amount of rain we've been having, 
the water level of Shinobazu Pond has risen.

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:52.660
Is that so?

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:55.140
I heard the Supernatural 
Division is stirring.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.400
They are?

00:02:58.370 --> 00:02:59.210
Yes.

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:08.960
It's clearing up.

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.800
Come on, Syunso-san! While the sun is out!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:14.420
Huh?

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.720
Let's go find the black cat.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.430
<b>I Miss You Dearly, Rainy Day</b>

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.970
Meow, meow, black kitty, meow...

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:35.470
So, what's your secret weapon today?

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:39.820
Silver vine! Cats just love silver vine.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.180
I see.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:45.390
Kitty, kitty, meow, kitty, kitty, meow...

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:48.690
Pigeons, coo, coo, pigeons, coo, coo...

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:52.820
Here, I have some delicious beans for you.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:56.490
Pigeons, coo, coo, pigeons, coo, coo...

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.700
This tempo is andante.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:02.330
Pigeons, coo, coo, pigeons, coo, coo...

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.850
Hey, wait!

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:14.750
Wait, come back!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:18.410
Do pigeons like silver vine, too?

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:19.900
I have no idea!

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.480
That was unexpected.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:39.360
Shinobazu Pond... I guess 
the stories were true.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.150
Let's go. It isn't safe here.

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:41.940
Okay.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:50.490
Hushabye, hushabye, my darling baby.

00:04:51.510 --> 00:05:01.410
You are such a good little 
child, hushabye now.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.460
Where—

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.180
What?

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.440
Pardon us.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.890
Now, wait just a minute!

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:18.810
You think I'm some weirdo that likes

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.150
to sing to myself as I stare
off at a pond, don't you?

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.810
Wait, you're not?

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:24.040
No!

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:31.310
So, the dragon goddess 
from your play escaped?

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.130
A divine spirit, huh?

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:37.800
What happened after she escaped?

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:40.940
She came here to Shinobazu Pond.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.690
The play I'm writing,<i> Demon Pond,</i> 
is a story about the dragon goddess,

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:48.800
Shirayuki, who is in love with 
the distant lord of Senja Pond.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:53.000
She only has one wish,

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.860
which is to go and be with the man she loves.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:06:01.850
However, because of a promise made long 
ago, she is unable to leave her pond.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:06.100
If she goes against that 
promise, Shirayuki will die

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:10.130
and a flood will occur, sinking the village 
into the watery depths.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:14.250
Shirayuki suffers because of this.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:20.360
To help console her,
 the villagers would sing a lullaby.

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:24.010
Oh, so that's why you were 
singing that song earlier.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.670
Yeah. Got it now?

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.100
Yes.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.370
On the night of the recent red full moon...

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.350
Shirayuki!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:37.170
Shirayuki was afraid that the play 
I was writing would end in tragedy,

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:38.940
so she escaped.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.630
Shirayuki, wait!

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:45.210
Shirayuki!

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:51.390
This long stretch of rain we've been 
having is because of her, as well.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:55.320
Then, will Shirayuki-san not
be reunited with her lover

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:57.850
in the play you're writing?

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:00.930
I'm not sure.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.160
Huh?

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.590
I don't even know.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:11.060
I can't continue writing unless 
Shirayuki returns to the play.

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.570
I want Shirayuki to come back.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:17.900
I want to write the rest of the story.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:24.280
M-Maybe there is something I can do to help!

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:27.740
We can get Shirayuki-san back together!

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:28.850
Wha?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.880
What the heck is a dolt like you gonna do?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.640
Those guys from the Supernatural 
Division are skulking around, too.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:40.130
If Shirayuki-san is slain by Fujita-san, 
<i>Demon Pond</i> will remain unfinished.

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:42.080
There has to be a way.

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:44.380
Don't touch me!

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.390
Let's come up with something 
together, Kyoka-san!

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:49.920
I never asked you to decide for me.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.030
It'll be fine.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.260
What part of it will?

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:53.860
Umm... All of it!

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:57.690
Absolutely not!

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.650
W-Why not?

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:05.880
You were supposed to be searching for 
Syunso's black cat, were you not?

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.350
Why were you in such a dangerous area?

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:12.160
Syunso, she was in your care.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.440
M-My apologies.

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:16.890
Syunso-san is not at fault.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.690
I just want to do something for 
Kyoka-san and Shirayuki-san.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:24.440
Mei, I want you to look for the black cat.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.690
I swear I won't do anything dangerous.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.120
Mei...

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.830
I am not a Tamayori,

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:37.320
so I would not be able to tell if something 
dangerous was getting close to you.

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.460
You understand, don't you?

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:44.570
Yes.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:50.710
Mei, can you speak English?

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.350
Eh?! Uh, w-well...

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.510
A-A little.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:09:00.170
Mei, you should study English more.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.200
There will be quite a 
number of foreign guests

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.980
at the upcoming formal 
fiancée presentation.

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:09.600
Do you understand, Mei?

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:12.110
Y-Yes, I do.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.860
Very good.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:23.240
He totally evaded me.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.680
Wait.

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.390
Syunso-san?

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:34.880
I don't think you should get involved.

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.090
Huh?

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:40.990
Unlike with my black cat, where the cause is clear,

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.850
Izumi is the only one who can
 resolve the Shirayuki situation.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.260
B-But...

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:52.030
You know, Ougai-san isn't the 
only one who worries about you.

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:16.770
Damn, will this blasted rain ever stop?

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:20.180
The pond is going to breach its banks
 tonight at this rate.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.590
Come home, Shirayuki.

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:33.930
You won't be able to accomplish 
anything staying here.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:37.520
Come back within me.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:47.830
That idiot...

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:55.240
I'm sorry, Ougai-san, but I just have to...

00:10:56.600 --> 00:11:01.660
Please, Shirayuki-san, go back to Kyoka-san.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:06.630
Never being able to be with the 
one you love is hard, isn't it?

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:11.170
I know how you must feel.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:14.860
I also want to be with the one I love.

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:20.990
You know, he even told me that 
he wanted me to stay forever.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:25.440
But I'm going to have to go back.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:30.060
I'll have to leave him in half a month.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:36.360
I'm sure I'll never be able 
to see him again after that.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.900
I want to stay with you forever...

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.380
Ougai-san.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.390
So it was a ghost after all.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.160
What's that?

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.160
Hey! Get away from the pond!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.440
Kyoka-san?

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:14.410
What the heck?!

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.670
You finally show yourself.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:21.850
Shirayuki!

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.530
That's Shirayuki-san?!

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.680
Crap, she's lost control.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:36.370
Come on, you dolt, hurry up!

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:37.440
R-Right.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:40.010
Shirayuki, calm down!

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:42.570
This isn't where you're supposed to be!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:55.830
Kyoka-san!

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:00.830
Shirayuki! I'm the one who created you!

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:03.850
So please come back to me!

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:08.410
Evacuate nearby residents immediately!

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:09.850
The banks are going to breach!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:14.660
Pretending to be a dragon 
god? Foolish ghost.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:18.480
Kyoka-san!

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.480
Izumi Kyoka?

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:24.850
How resentful I am...

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:30.310
Were it not for that accursed promise, 
I could be with my beloved for all eternity.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:33.120
Shirayuki...

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.880
Cease with that infernal noise!

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.630
Izumi Kyoka!

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:48.140
What is a lowly writer 
like you doing here?

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:53.760
It appears that you have something 
to do with this endless rain.

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.000
Tell me all the details.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.480
Please wait!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.510
You again? Move!

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:00.950
I will not.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:04.030
Kyoka-san is trying to help Shirayuki-san!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:07.200
Shirayuki? Is that the name of that monster?

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:12.410
I want to see him.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:18.030
I want to be with my beloved right now!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.040
Shirayuki!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.550
Please listen to us, Shirayuki-san!

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:26.210
Insolent humans! Do not come near me.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:28.420
I will no longer listen to anyone!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.300
The monster is right there!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:37.050
I will not cast aside love for my life.

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:40.830
Every single one of you!

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:44.890
I will trample anyone who 
dares to try and stop me!

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:46.650
No, Shirayuki-san!

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.300
Stop!

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:54.520
You idiot!

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:34.830
<i>Shirayuki-san...</i>

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:42.550
<i>Please, go back to Kyoka-san.</i>

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:48.720
<i>The man you love is within Kyoka-san.</i>

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:58.510
<i>I cannot believe the words of a human.</i>

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:02.860
<i>You will never be able to 
see him again like this.</i>

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:07.480
<i>Shirayuki-san, please believe in Kyoka-san.</i>

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.320
<i>Believe in him.</i>

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.310
<i>I can't breathe.</i>

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.780
<i>Ougai-san, I'm so sorry.</i>

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:31.880
<i>I know I promised I wouldn't 
do anything dangerous.</i>

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:49.860
<i>Shirayuki!</i>

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:59.670
<i>Come back to me, Shirayuki.</i>

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:02.270
<i>Shirayuki...</i>

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:04.110
<i>If...</i>

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:12.680
<i>If you can't do that, then I will share 
my fate with you here!</i>

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:18.250
<i>Shira...</i>

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:40.200
Mei! Mei!

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:42.460
Mei!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.320
Mei!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:53.300
Ougai-san...

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:56.570
You fool!

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.730
You fool...

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:05.140
Ougai-san.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.510
Shirayuki-san...

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:40.380
Love creates such remarkable
strength of spirit.

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:45.380
I will return, back to within you.

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:52.490
Back to my beloved.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.460
Shirayuki!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:10.600
Shirayuki...

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:32.770
Shirayuki-san, you went 
back inside Kyoka-san.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:07.880
I-It hurts!

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:09.360
Muscle pain?!

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:15.340
G-Good morning.

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:18.350
Well, good morning, Little Squirrel.

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:21.100
Did you sleep well?

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:24.620
I-I did, and, well...

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.360
You have a visitor.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.870
Kyoka-san!

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:34.880
You doing okay?

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.520
Yes, I am! No, I'm in pain.

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:42.290
My story is progressing.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:45.770
Really? That's great!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:49.780
So, what's going to happen 
with Shirayuki-san's romance?

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:51.530
You want to know?

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.280
Of course I do!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:56.930
I can't just tell you the 
outcome of a creative work.

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:01.350
If you're interested, come 
and see it next month.

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:03.790
A certain third-rate actor 
will be performing it.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.650
Third-rate actor?

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:08.390
Oh, you mean Otojiro-san!

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:10.730
Okay, then I will definitely 
come and see it.

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:14.290
I wonder how everything 
is going to turn out!

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:17.300
Okay, but please tell me 
just one little detail.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:18.000
Not a chance!

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.820
Then at least tell me if 
everything works out.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.030
That would be like giving it all away.

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.800
I hope your romance works out as well.

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:40.510
You pushed yourself too far.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.580
Does that mean it works out 
for Shirayuki-san, too?!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.180
I'm so glad!

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:45.940
Thank you so much!

00:21:54.310 --> 00:21:57.960
Y-You're so weird! I'm the 
one who was thanking you.

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:01.760
See you next month.

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:03.940
Yes, next month.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:10.510
<i>Next month...</i>

00:22:14.510 --> 00:22:17.410
<i>I will no longer</i>

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:25.550
<i>be here next month.</i>

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:27.250
W-Wait, not that way.
 I want to go this way. Woah!

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:29.640
Ougai-san! Come on, this way.

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:32.250
Ouch! Don't be so rough, Syunso! That hurts!

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Next Episode Preview

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Masagocho Cat Café Incident

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:32.960
A goroumushi? 
Don't be ridiculous.

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:35.520
Who told you to help
 with the cooking?

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:39.730
Cut the pickles into pieces! 
 Don't let the miso soup boil!
